theorem k215PEq4726CleanYCycleS1 (y z: nat): $ k215PIter 1 (k215PEq4726State 5 0 (suc y) z) = (k215PEq4726State 7 0 (suc y) z) $ = '(eqtr k215PIter_succ (eqtr (k215PStepeq k215PIter_zero) k215PEq4726Step5Z));

